    IDS_INFO                "JUMP DRIVE MFD 2.0:\r\n\r\nProvides hyper-jump capabilities for every vessel in your scenario. To make travelling with a jump-drive more challenging, the jumping distance is fixed (although adjustable via INI file).\r\nTherefore, to get near your target, you have to think about the course of the jump. The integrated navigation computer helps you with this task.\r\n\r\nCheck 'http://bitbucket.org/face/jumpdrivemfd' for new versions."
